{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FOREST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the environment and enter Ridgecourt Forest, classified as extremely dangerous. Since the last police raid, killed people and missing officers have still not been found. Noone has ever tried to enter the area, expect Silas, a young detective and former police officer. His daughter has gone missing 4 months ago, locals reported several strange activities including female voices and screams. Entering the abandoned Asylum, lurking in the deep dark of Ridgecourt's Forest, is the only possible way to rescue his daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/a4e3ee95efb082fb8ec32354cd2d0c70.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ASYLUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police say that Jake Kron, a scientist known for his strange and crazy scientifical experiments, still lives and works in the abandoned asylum. Investigations indicate that he uses human beings, mostly desperate and poor ones, for his experiments. Silas is the only one brave enough to enter the asylum. His equipment, including a gun and a flashlight, quickly proves to be useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/d7d05d5bc6ea4e0fcb667f360753f71b.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SEWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground system has never been able to enjoy normal use. Escaped inmates, failed experiments, and kidnapped police officers haunt the sewer system. The stench of excrement and dead bodies adds to the discomfort. Nevertheless, they are all searching for the only way out: suicide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/628febd5ae98243ff278683780363f8f.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems as if all electronic and security-related matters are managed from here. The surroundings appear deserted and barricaded. Doesn't anyone want to release him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/aff2a411e173fe5f4818558aa3a54a8a.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few of the many areas Silas encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ON YOUR INVESTIGATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DARK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting effects make exploring with a flashlight all the more intense and frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/c3a9571dce32bcf60a9e5643f0e725a3.poster.avif?t=1769015832\" width=514 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/c3a9571dce32bcf60a9e5643f0e725a3.webm?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/c3a9571dce32bcf60a9e5643f0e725a3.mp4?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE ENVIRONMENTAL PUZZLES </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of environmental puzzles you will try to escape from the asylum and fight your way through the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/cb21bcd934271e24e3908d0784663bfd.poster.avif?t=1769015832\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/cb21bcd934271e24e3908d0784663bfd.webm?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/cb21bcd934271e24e3908d0784663bfd.mp4?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DONT LET THEM GET YOU</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping from this mayhem won't be as easy as expected. Unknown test subjects called &quot;Entities&quot; will try to kill you all along the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/95561118bcfab62f693e7b2e55596934.poster.avif?t=1769015832\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/95561118bcfab62f693e7b2e55596934.webm?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/95561118bcfab62f693e7b2e55596934.mp4?t=1769015832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049970?t=1769015832","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/8370d5541ebf9d7c58e05b9cb638c136df0982d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769015832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/dae397e9efa34b23da71f9f7b3774dc1bf96b33f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769015832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/dae397e9efa34b23da71f9f7b3774dc1bf96b33f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769015832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game depicts various types of mutilation and self-harm. Murder, extreme violence, suicide, and bloodshed are explicitly portrayed."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FOREST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the environment and enter Ridgecourt Forest, classified as extremely dangerous. Since the last police raid, killed people and missing officers have still not been found. Noone has ever tried to enter the area, expect Silas, a young detective and former police officer. His daughter has gone missing 4 months ago, locals reported several strange activities including female voices and screams. Entering the abandoned Asylum, lurking in the deep dark of Ridgecourt's Forest, is the only possible way to rescue his daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/a4e3ee95efb082fb8ec32354cd2d0c70.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ASYLUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police say that Jake Kron, a scientist known for his strange and crazy scientifical experiments, still lives and works in the abandoned asylum. Investigations indicate that he uses human beings, mostly desperate and poor ones, for his experiments. Silas is the only one brave enough to enter the asylum. His equipment, including a gun and a flashlight, quickly proves to be useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/d7d05d5bc6ea4e0fcb667f360753f71b.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SEWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground system has never been able to enjoy normal use. Escaped inmates, failed experiments, and kidnapped police officers haunt the sewer system. The stench of excrement and dead bodies adds to the discomfort. Nevertheless, they are all searching for the only way out: suicide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/628febd5ae98243ff278683780363f8f.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems as if all electronic and security-related matters are managed from here. The surroundings appear deserted and barricaded. Doesn't anyone want to release him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049970/extras/aff2a411e173fe5f4818558aa3a54a8a.avif?t=1769015832\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few of the many areas Silas encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ON YOUR INVESTIGATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DARK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting effects make exploring with a flashlight all the more intense and frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli